{
	"_doc": "The menus a new career unlocks while it plays (MenuUnlocks, src/tycoon/tutorial/menu_unlocks.gd; HudUnlocker shows them). Each item: id, nodes (HUD nodes it shows: a unique name '%Name', a rail button name 'Crew' or a path from the HUD root 'Side/Race'; nodes that do not exist yet are skipped), screen (the screen it opens: opening it by any way unlocks the item), name_key (i18n), lesson (Vovô's lesson when it appears, data/tycoon/tutorials.json), start (open from the first week), when (a list of conditions, any one unlocks it; each condition is a dictionary whose keys must all hold), fair_week (modo feira: the career week at which it unlocks anyway). Condition keys: projects, launches, research_points, cash_below, reputation, era, weeks, building, milestones, contracts, item, lesson, screen. Items are revealed one at a time in this order.",
